  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc58:2.1.4": "The six are linen, cotton, silk, wool, sunn hemp, and hemp; see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-kd8/en/brahmali#3.1.6'>Kd 8:3.1.6</a>. ",
