  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc58:2.1.10": "According to Vin-vn-ṭ 1626 (presumably commenting on <i lang='pi' translate='no'>kaddamena</i> in Kkh): <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Kaddamenāti udakānukaddamasukkhakaddamādiṁ saṅgaṇhāti</i>, “With mud means: water with mud, dry mud, etc., is included.” ",
